{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And she shall shave her head.</b> Like the law of the metzora, in the manner of those who go from profane to holy, as the Levites did." "<b>And she shall do her nails.</b> She shall trim them, and the term shaving does not apply to them, but rather the term of doing and tending. Similar to it: 'did not do his legs' and 'did not do his mustache' — and this is according to Rabbi Eliezer."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:36.857354904Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}